+### Repo-relative census invocation
+
+Run `check_bible.py` from the `lore-shokunin/` root with repo-relative
+arguments, for example:
+
+```sh
+python3 corpus/fixtures/check_bible.py corpus/fixtures/r5-missing-file
+```
